{
 "doc": "M4-C11-02 greybox (tools/act1/ch11_greybox.py; do not edit by hand): Sunken Vey, the drowned galleries, at an overcast midday (colour script ch11). A Lit Age city's arcades half under a still turquoise lagoon, their roofs the walks. From the landing (west) to the conduit court, where a conduit bleeds bound teal and Liss reads the Saltwright housing-mark (conduit_mark); a side gallery north to a fig-choked end; east to Lowlight's gate (to_lowlight). The story waits on the beat sheet (M4-C11-01).",
